{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17929","headline":"秋怀诗十一首 二 · 韩愈","name":"秋怀诗十一首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白露下百草，萧兰共雕悴。\n青青四墙下，已复生满地。\n寒蝉暂寂寞，蟋蟀鸣自恣。\n运行无穷期，禀受气苦异。\n适时各得所，松栢不必贵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}